       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TVENEXEC.
       AUTHOR.        FRED HAYNES.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  APRIL 19, 1980.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *C   4/11/94.   MARVIN MITCHELL  REQUEST #6490
      *C     COMMENTED EACH OF THE 'COPY' CODE STATEMENTS AT
      *C     THE END OF THIS PROGRAM, AND COPIED THE ACTUAL
      *C     COPYLIB MEMBERS' SOURCE CODE.
      *C
      *C   8/08/94.   MARVIN MITCHELL
      *C   CHANGED ALL REFERENCES OF COPYLIB/COPYMMIS TO COPYLIB.
      *C
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG            PIC X          VALUE "Y".
      *
      * DATABASE AREA
      *
       COPY FILESTAT IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DATAB    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.
       01  ITEM-LISTS.
           05 ALL-ITEMS                  PIC X(02) VALUE "@;".
       01  ARG-VALUES.
           05 PLT-ARG                    PIC X(04) VALUE "P 01".
       01  DSET-NAMES.
           05 DSET-NAME                  PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
           05 DSET-MPLTINFO              PIC X(16) VALUE "MPLTINFO;".

      *
      * SUBPROGRAM AREA
      *
       01  SPOOLER-NUMBER                PIC S9(2) BINARY.
       COPY TSPLPRT  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TSHWRDFM IN COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMAREA IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGUAGE IN COPYLIB.

       01  FORMFILE.
           05  FORM-FNAME                PIC X(8)  VALUE "FVENEXEC".
           05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE ".".
           05  FORM-GNAME.
               10  FORM-GNAME1           PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
               10  FORM-GNAME2           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       MAIN-LINE-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1-INIT.

           CALL "SVENEXES" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, SPOOLER-NUMBER,
                                 MPLTINFO-COMPANY,
                                 LANGUAGE-PARMS, FORMFILE.

           PERFORM 9999-CLOSES.
           GOBACK.

      ****************************************************************
      * PARAGRAPH : 1-INIT                                           *
      * PURPOSE   : INITAILIZATION ROUTINE                           *
      ****************************************************************
       1-INIT.

           PERFORM 9999-OPENS.
      *
      * GET PLANT NUMBER
      *
           PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           IF NOT GOOD-CALL
             MOVE "ERROR GETTING PLANT INFORMATION IN 1-INIT" TO
               BU-DISPLAY-MSG
             PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP
           END-IF.

           CALL "TSPLPRT" USING SP-RET-CODE, SP-AREA.
           IF SP-RET-CODE NOT EQUAL "00"

             MOVE "SP-RET-CODE = " TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD(1)
             MOVE SP-RET-CODE TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD(2)
             MOVE "TSPLPRT CALL ERR IN 1-INIT" TO
               BU-DISPLAY-MSG
             PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP

           END-IF
           MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO(1) TO SPOOLER-NUMBER.

      ****************************************************************
      * PARAGRAPH : 2100-BLOWUP                                      *
      * PURPOSE   : TO LOG ERROR MESSAGE AND ABORT PROGRAM           *
      ****************************************************************
       2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TVENEXEC" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           MOVE VIEW-NFNAME TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, DUMMY-KSAM-STAT, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       9999-OPENS.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-PK-I.

       9999-CLOSES.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-PK-I.

       9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-PK-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               IF HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE "GETKEY ERR 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

